==Description==
'''Rat King Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in [[The Final Act Event#The Final Act Battle Pass|The Final Act Battle Pass]] as a reward for reaching Level 19 on the regular track. It had a cost of {{PlushieSnowman|575}} or {{Robux|98}} ({{Robux|78}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale) to unlock, with a total cost of {{PlushieSnowman|5,100}} or {{Robux|1,515}} ({{Robux|1,204}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale).

==Appearance==
'''Rat King Charm''' has the {{Color|FinalAct|Rat King}} [[Crook Boss]] standing on a stage with two lights while holding a scepter. It plays the default charm placement sound.

The color of the '''Rat King Charm''' depends on the color of the player's name in chat, but it is red in its preview in the inventory.

